sender alice basic
sender bob pro
sender cora bulk
recipient rx
recipient ny tz=-05:00
recipient tokyo tz=+09:00
set-for rx quiet.start 00:00
set-for rx quiet.end 06:00
send n1 alice rx normal waits
send n2 bob rx prio=urgent urgent goes
send n3 bob rx prio=urgent urgent second
advance 10s
at d0 06:00:02
inbox rx
